Alexander Chislenko makes some timely points:

>  I remember reading in "Sci. Am."  about the ethical style of medieval
>scientific discussions.   In some (not untypical) scientific article a
>famous proponent of the Gregorian calendar cited his counterpart as
>"This fat Bavarian pig..."
